WEBVTT

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:05.230
Flying in the sky

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:07.360
<i>takaku habatake</i>
Soar high up

00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:10.110
<i>oozora o dokomade mo</i>
Anywhere across the sky

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:11.940
Shining Finger

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:13.820
<i>kagayaku hikari ga</i>
The shining light

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:17.200
<i>chi no hate terashi kiseki o yobu spell</i>
A spell that spreads
miracles throughout the world

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:20.660
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:26.330
<i>furimukazu aruku no sa</i>
Walk forward and never turn back

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:32.590
<i>mugen no chikara ga aru</i>
I have an unlimited power

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:40.010
<i>nando demo tamesu no sa</i>
I must test myself many times

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:48.350
<i>donna ni kurushikutemo yaritogeru</i>
Do it all no matter how painful

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:51.650
<i>ai wa itsumo kono mune ni</i>
Love is always in my heart

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:55.150
<i>towa ni kieru koto wa nai</i>
It will never fade

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:58.240
<i>kono te ga sakendeiru</i>
My hand cries out loud

00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:02.240
<i>ashita e to hashire</i>
To run toward tomorrow

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:04.000
Bright you now

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:08.910
<i>kimi ga egaita mirai e no shinario wa</i>
The future that you envision

00:01:09.310 --> 00:01:10.840
Shining Finger

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:12.500
<i>yume o tsukamou</i>
Take hold of our dreams

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:16.050
<i>subete wa omou mama ni I get a chance</i>
Everything will go
my way if I get a chance

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:32.860
Hey, have you heard
the rumors?

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:35.530
About Dahal Muhammad?

00:01:35.530 --> 00:01:37.530
You mean our hero?

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:40.280
But I thought he was dead.

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:41.570
I know that, but...

00:01:41.570 --> 00:01:46.160
...I hear that Dahal's been
spotted here in Neo Egypt...

00:01:46.160 --> 00:01:49.040
...with his Mummy Gundam IV.

00:01:49.330 --> 00:01:50.290
Out of the question!

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:53.500
But many people have seen him.

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:57.220
He always appears during a
sandstorm, much like tonight's...

00:02:01.970 --> 00:02:03.220
Wh-who's there?!

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:11.900
Wh-why you're...

00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:13.440
Dahal!

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:28.450
Even during these times when
Earth has become so filthy...

00:02:28.450 --> 00:02:31.370
...many relics from the
ancient days of glory...

00:02:31.370 --> 00:02:34.790
...have remained untouched
here in Neo Egypt.

00:02:35.670 --> 00:02:36.820
However...

00:02:36.820 --> 00:02:38.670
...that's not all.

00:02:38.670 --> 00:02:41.450
There is an ominous legend
that says...

00:02:41.450 --> 00:02:44.430
..."When a storm of battles
swirls about in this world...

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:47.500
...the spirit of a
courageous soldier...

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:50.100
...shall rise from a long sleep,
bearing his hatred."

00:02:54.150 --> 00:02:55.820
Now, everyone...

00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:58.520
...today's opponent is a challenger
from the grave...

00:02:58.520 --> 00:03:01.380
...the Pharaoh Gundam IV of Neo Egypt...

00:02:59.170 --> 00:03:03.450
Neo Egypt
Pharaoh Gundam IV

00:03:01.380 --> 00:03:02.860
The strange thing is that...

00:03:02.860 --> 00:03:05.940
...the Fighter, Dahal Muhammad...

00:03:05.940 --> 00:03:08.030
...is already dead.

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:11.000
That's crazy!

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:13.620
You might think so...

00:03:13.620 --> 00:03:16.040
...but this phantom may,
in fact, be the key...

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:19.630
...to the whereabouts of
Domon's brother Kyoji...

00:03:19.630 --> 00:03:21.800
...who descended to Earth
with the Devil Gundam.

00:03:22.130 --> 00:03:23.630
And now!

00:03:23.630 --> 00:03:28.140
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:34.440
Terror of the Phantom Fighter!

00:03:43.150 --> 00:03:45.370
Wh-what's this?

00:03:56.040 --> 00:03:57.220
It's horrible.

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:00.000
Domon?

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:01.300
He's still alive!

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:03.130
Rain, prepare to treat him!

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:04.510
Right!

00:04:07.850 --> 00:04:09.180
Hey! Help's on the way!

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:11.350
He was...

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:13.640
He was here...

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:15.810
He was supposed to be dead.

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:17.020
What do you mean by that?

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:19.400
Everyone...

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:21.210
Everyone was killed...

00:04:22.150 --> 00:04:23.070
Who did it?

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:24.110
Who did this to you?!

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:26.070
Dahal...

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:36.460
The cockpit was destroyed
with a single blow.

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:39.170
This cruel attack could've been...

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:40.170
Domon!

00:04:40.290 --> 00:04:42.170
Look!
A Gundam Fight!

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:43.170
What?!

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:09.740
Hey! We haven't declared
this to be a match yet!

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:14.500
Fight like a man!

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:16.690
Yeah, I did it!

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:22.340
What the...?!

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:28.760
He's aiming at the cockpit!

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:38.980
Trying not to give me the chance
to counterattack, is that it?!

00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:51.700
Hey, that was Dragon Gundam!

00:05:53.030 --> 00:05:54.310
Who's his opponent?!

00:06:00.330 --> 00:06:01.960
Neo Egypt's Gundam?!

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:03.090
Can't be...

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:06.090
Then, what were those ruins
we saw before?!

00:06:06.510 --> 00:06:08.510
It's time I finished you off.

00:06:08.590 --> 00:06:11.470
Spin! Feiron Flag!

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:17.480
Looks like you lose!

00:06:18.980 --> 00:06:19.730
Watch out!

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:43.380
Article 2 of the Gundam Fight
International Regulations...

00:06:43.580 --> 00:06:46.590
"A pilot must never aim
at the cockpit of a Gundam."

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:49.130
But I... But I...

00:06:49.510 --> 00:06:52.010
I just killed him...

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:54.660
...with my own hands.

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:08.360
That's strange.

00:07:08.360 --> 00:07:10.490
I'm sure this is the place.

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:13.610
Y-you're just kidding, right?
Right, huh? Bro?

00:07:13.870 --> 00:07:14.870
No.

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:18.200
We found Neo Egypt's Gundam,
destroyed and laying in ruins here.

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:20.160
And its crew was here, too.

00:07:20.160 --> 00:07:22.080
But, Mr. Domon...

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:26.290
How do you explain the
Gundam that Sai Saici fought?

00:07:26.670 --> 00:07:29.950
Could it be a gh-ghost?

00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:35.090
If it was a ghost,
you'd be the one it'll possess.

00:07:35.090 --> 00:07:36.760
It's got nothing to do with me.

00:07:38.180 --> 00:07:40.640
Don't go, Bro!

00:07:40.850 --> 00:07:44.350
Y-you can't just leave
after scaring me like that.

00:07:44.600 --> 00:07:46.690
Please stay here with me.

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:48.820
Even if it's just for the night!

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:52.280
I just can't stand these
creepy situations!

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:54.200
Hey!

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:11.960
You know...

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:16.910
Do you think this incident...

00:08:16.910 --> 00:08:19.100
...might have something to do
with our mission?

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:21.120
I don't know.

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:23.060
However...

00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:26.230
...the one thing these ruins
would be useful for...

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:29.820
...is the Devil Gundam's
ability to self recover...

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:32.150
...one of its three special abilities.

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:34.860
Then, your brother
may be involved...

00:08:35.030 --> 00:08:37.820
Shut up!
Never call him my brother!

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:42.620
I'm sorry.
Never again.

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:47.790
Please forgive me!

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:50.710
I didn't mean to kill you!

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:56.090
Where're you going?

00:08:56.090 --> 00:08:57.440
Got to pee.

00:08:58.090 --> 00:09:00.720
Right.
Don't wet yourself.

00:09:02.310 --> 00:09:05.640
Yeah, all right, all right.
I know that, already.

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:08.420
Stop treating me like a kid.

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:23.660
What's wrong?!

00:09:24.160 --> 00:09:25.710
Mr. Domon!

00:09:25.710 --> 00:09:29.500
Sai Saici has informed us that
he's seen a mummy!

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:30.630
A mummy?

00:09:30.630 --> 00:09:33.880
A mummy!
I saw a mummy!

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:54.610
Hey, where're we going now, sis?

00:09:54.900 --> 00:09:55.860
To a tomb.

00:09:56.030 --> 00:09:57.320
What?!

00:09:57.740 --> 00:10:00.070
Look. We can see it now.

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:11.500
The last word of the Neo Egypt
crew member was "Dahal".

00:10:11.960 --> 00:10:14.380
I did some research,
which led me to this place.

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:17.590
That's right. Dahal Muhammad was...

00:10:17.590 --> 00:10:20.930
...the champion of the
Third Gundam Fight.

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:22.720
Their Fighter fought bravely...

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:25.530
...and gave Neo Egypt
sovereign rights to the world.

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:30.770
This is his tomb,
erected in honor of his heroics.

00:10:35.070 --> 00:10:37.150
So, the ghost we're looking for...

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:39.990
...is a former Gundam Fighter.

00:10:40.860 --> 00:10:41.990
That's nice.

00:10:41.990 --> 00:10:43.120
I'm going home.

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:46.330
We're going in.

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:49.360
No way! No way! No! No!
I want to go home!

00:10:49.360 --> 00:10:51.920
This has nothing to do
with the Gundam Fight!

00:10:51.920 --> 00:10:53.670
How humiliating!

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:58.170
Resting on your shoulders is the
future of the Shaolin Temple.

00:10:58.170 --> 00:11:01.180
But you act so cowardly at
the sight of a ghost?

00:11:01.180 --> 00:11:02.050
Keiun!

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:03.300
Zuisen!

00:11:03.390 --> 00:11:07.020
What are we to do
as we head into the future?

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:14.270
Okay, I get the message.

00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:21.650
This place is creepy.

00:11:21.650 --> 00:11:24.780
They set up wicked traps
in places like these.

00:11:24.780 --> 00:11:25.950
Better be careful.

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:34.740
Sai Saici!

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:36.130
Mr. Domon!

00:11:39.590 --> 00:11:42.510
Ow... Anyone hurt?

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:44.510
I somehow survived.

00:11:44.510 --> 00:11:47.850
This is why I didn't want to come.

00:11:52.190 --> 00:11:53.350
That's...

00:11:53.350 --> 00:11:54.730
It sure is.

00:11:54.940 --> 00:11:57.020
Dahal's resting place.

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:10.950
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:14.920
What do you plan to do, Bro?

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:16.750
It's obvious.

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:18.800
I'm gonna have to open
Dahal's coffin.

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:22.450
Y-you're out of your mind, Bro!

00:12:22.450 --> 00:12:24.440
Th-that's got to be bad luck!
Stop!

00:12:24.440 --> 00:12:27.680
D-don't do it! Please!
Don't do it! I'm scared!

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:29.430
Don't do it! Don't do it!

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:31.520
Hey, Bro!
Listen to me, Bro!

00:12:35.730 --> 00:12:38.040
Sai Saici, come look inside.

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:41.070
No way, no way!
I'm too scared, I'm too scared!

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:44.030
No, no, no! Please!

00:12:44.300 --> 00:12:47.490
As you can see,
there's nothing in there.

00:12:47.570 --> 00:12:51.120
But that means the mummy
out there really is Dahal, right?

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:03.010
Domon...

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:03.840
Yeah.

00:13:19.150 --> 00:13:20.060
Run!

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:22.530
Take Rain with you now, and run!

00:13:22.530 --> 00:13:23.530
Right!

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:30.510
Sai Saici!

00:13:33.490 --> 00:13:35.580
Leave Sai Saici alone!

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:37.670
Fight me, you monster!

00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:42.590
What's this?!

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:54.770
Rain! Use it now!

00:13:54.770 --> 00:13:55.580
Right!

00:14:15.790 --> 00:14:17.580
What's happening?

00:14:27.970 --> 00:14:29.660
Yeah! Yeah!

00:14:29.660 --> 00:14:31.430
The mummy's been destroyed!

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:34.060
No. He's indestructible.

00:14:34.310 --> 00:14:35.520
Take a look!

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:44.440
Sai Saici...

00:14:44.440 --> 00:14:48.070
...I don't know why,
but he won't give up on you.

00:14:48.320 --> 00:14:51.360
You've got no choice but to
settle it with him.

00:14:51.360 --> 00:14:54.830
I-I can't...
It's not even an official battle.

00:14:55.450 --> 00:14:57.870
Prove you're worthy
of the Shaolin Temple!

00:15:02.540 --> 00:15:04.880
Trembling at this sort of thing...

00:15:04.880 --> 00:15:07.210
You're embarrassing Neo China.

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:10.680
That's easy for you to say!

00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:23.020
What are you doing, Sai Saici?!

00:15:23.290 --> 00:15:25.980
You cannot fight it
if you keep retreating!

00:15:26.770 --> 00:15:28.440
But...

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:47.250
What is wrong, Sai Saici?!

00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:49.340
This attack should be no problem!

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:51.470
Focus! Put your mind to it!

00:15:51.470 --> 00:15:55.680
That's easy to say,
but I can't move!

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:02.030
Oh! Sai Saici!

00:16:02.730 --> 00:16:04.190
Mr. Domon Kasshu.

00:16:04.480 --> 00:16:08.320
This is not an official Fight.
So, please give him a hand.

00:16:08.570 --> 00:16:10.150
No. Not yet.

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:11.610
H-how come?

00:16:11.610 --> 00:16:12.860
Wait!

00:16:13.110 --> 00:16:16.740
I think I've figured out why
Dahal is only targeting Sai Saici.

00:16:16.740 --> 00:16:17.950
What?!

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:20.540
Got it!

00:16:20.870 --> 00:16:21.830
Of course!

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:23.210
Miss Rain!

00:16:23.210 --> 00:16:25.000
What is the reason?

00:16:26.080 --> 00:16:28.340
We were never aware of this!

00:16:29.420 --> 00:16:30.880
Sai Saici!

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:33.340
Listen! Listen well!

00:16:33.800 --> 00:16:36.180
It all happened 40 years ago!

00:16:36.520 --> 00:16:40.520
Dahal did in fact become champion
of the Third Gundam Fight!

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:41.520
However...

00:16:41.520 --> 00:16:44.140
...four years later,
at the Fourth Tournament...

00:16:47.190 --> 00:16:50.020
During the Finals
of the tournament...

00:16:50.020 --> 00:16:52.690
...the opposing Gundam took out
the head of Dahal's Gundam.

00:16:53.000 --> 00:16:56.030
But, at that moment,
the cockpit blew up.

00:16:56.950 --> 00:16:58.490
And Dahal perished as a result.

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:03.500
The opposing Fighter
in that match...

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:06.920
...was none other than the
Master of the Shaolin Temple!

00:17:07.130 --> 00:17:09.750
The Fighter was your grandfather!

00:17:09.840 --> 00:17:10.960
You're kidding!

00:17:11.260 --> 00:17:14.140
Dahal was defeated by a Shaolin
opponent during a match...

00:17:14.140 --> 00:17:17.090
...and I believe his conscience,
or rather...

00:17:17.090 --> 00:17:20.970
...his pride as a Fighter
is hoping for a rematch.

00:17:24.770 --> 00:17:27.730
His need to fight is so strong,
he'll even fight as a mummy.

00:17:37.810 --> 00:17:39.620
Okay, I understand.

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:43.410
Dahal continues to fight even
after his body's quit breathing.

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:44.580
As a Fighter...

00:17:45.160 --> 00:17:48.290
...I've got to accept his challenge
for a Gundam match!

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:53.170
Okay!

00:17:53.550 --> 00:17:56.260
Gundam Fight!

00:17:56.380 --> 00:17:57.880
Ready!

00:17:57.880 --> 00:17:58.760
Go!

00:18:05.680 --> 00:18:09.650
Hohka kyoten juzetsujin!

00:18:22.490 --> 00:18:24.700
Go! Baopei!

00:18:39.430 --> 00:18:41.790
Good work, Sai Saici!

00:18:55.230 --> 00:18:58.110
Rest in peace.
This time for certain.

00:19:05.490 --> 00:19:06.970
Hey, what is this?

00:19:14.420 --> 00:19:16.590
No! It can't be...!

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:18.630
Stay back from this point on!

00:19:20.510 --> 00:19:25.760
Shining Finger!

00:19:29.060 --> 00:19:31.520
Wh-what's going on here?!

00:19:31.770 --> 00:19:33.310
Stay back, Sai Saici.

00:19:33.310 --> 00:19:35.640
I've been waiting for this
a long time!

00:19:43.200 --> 00:19:44.700
B-Bro...

00:19:54.330 --> 00:19:56.670
Wh-who is this creature?

00:19:56.670 --> 00:19:58.130
Sai Saici.

00:19:58.130 --> 00:20:00.880
It's not your concern.
However!

00:20:01.230 --> 00:20:03.550
This ability to self recover...

00:20:03.550 --> 00:20:07.010
...allowing the deceased Dahal
and his Gundam to resurrect!

00:20:08.930 --> 00:20:10.600
I'm positive!

00:20:11.020 --> 00:20:14.770
He has abilities
of the Devil Gundam...

00:20:14.770 --> 00:20:17.610
...with the help of Kyoji!

00:20:38.960 --> 00:20:41.960
This hand of mine glows
with an awesome power!

00:20:42.800 --> 00:20:45.760
Its burning grip tells me
to defeat you!

00:20:45.760 --> 00:20:46.680
Take this!

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:49.640
My love, my anger,
and all of my sorrow!

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:54.160
Shining Finger!

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:58.860
Go! Go! Go!

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:08.200
He's changed to that form again...

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:16.870
He has proven he is
the King of Hearts.

00:21:17.500 --> 00:21:19.400
Domon Kasshu.

00:21:20.880 --> 00:21:23.590
He'll even corrupt Dahal's
genuine fighting spirit...

00:21:23.590 --> 00:21:25.590
...into something evil.

00:21:25.590 --> 00:21:26.800
Yes.

00:21:30.350 --> 00:21:32.680
Once faced by
the Devil Gundam...

00:21:32.680 --> 00:21:35.100
...even the dead will
become like this.

00:21:45.570 --> 00:21:48.870
I don't understand, Bro.

00:21:52.620 --> 00:21:53.830
Don't cry, Rain.

00:21:57.670 --> 00:21:59.880
Our battle has only just begun.

00:22:00.670 --> 00:22:02.460
B-but...

00:22:02.880 --> 00:22:05.800
...your opponent is your
own brother.

00:22:27.570 --> 00:22:32.200
<i>Ikusen no tsukihi ga nagaretemo</i>
No matter how much time passes

00:22:32.580 --> 00:22:36.580
<i>tadori tsukenu basho o</i>
There's a place I can never reach

00:22:36.870 --> 00:22:41.040
<i>samayoi motomenagara</i>
As I wander, continuing my search

00:22:41.500 --> 00:22:44.590
<i>aruite yuku</i>
I keep going forward

00:22:44.880 --> 00:22:51.760
<i>koibito yo,</i>
watashi no hitomi no oku de
Deep within my stare, my love

00:22:52.260 --> 00:22:57.480
<i>kasuka ni yureteiru shinjitsu ga</i>
There is a truth that gently floats

00:22:57.680 --> 00:23:02.730
<i>dore hodo tsutawaru no desho</i>
How much of it will you catch?

00:23:02.900 --> 00:23:09.280
<i>Kizutsuita kokoro to karada azukete</i>
Give me your injured body and spirit

00:23:09.650 --> 00:23:13.410
<i>atataka na kono mune de</i>
I will hold you against my warm heart

00:23:13.570 --> 00:23:19.410
<i>umi yori mo fukaku nemutte</i>
So you can sleep deeper than the sea

00:23:33.910 --> 00:23:36.140
While in rainy Neo Turkey...

00:23:36.140 --> 00:23:39.020
...Rain is reunited
with her former boyfriend.

00:23:39.020 --> 00:23:40.760
But, to her horror...

00:23:40.760 --> 00:23:43.810
...she discovers that he's become
a slave to the Devil Gundam.

00:23:43.810 --> 00:23:48.970
Will Rain succeed in saving
him from evil?

00:23:49.320 --> 00:23:51.990
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:51.990 --> 00:23:55.110
Reunion in the Falling Rain.

00:23:53.850 --> 00:23:59.700
Reunion in the Falling Rain

00:23:55.120 --> 00:23:57.740
Ready! Go!
